   otherwise give the Software, any part of it, or any modified version, to anyone else.
   (Rights that GitHub's Terms of Service give to other GitHub users, such as viewing or
   forking this public repository on GitHub, are not affected by this license.)
b) Resell or commercialize it: you may not sell the Software or charge for access to it.
c) Make money with it: you may not use the Software, its models or its output, directly or
   indirectly, to earn money or in any for-profit activity. This includes client work,
   paid services, a product or service of a company, advertising-funded sites, and
   offering it online as a service (even for free) to other people.
d) Train or improve other AI models with the model files, or extract their weights into
   another model.
e) Remove or change the copyright notices, this license, or the credit required below.

3. CREDIT
If you mention, show or publish anything that uses the Software or its models (a personal
project, an article, a video, a repository, a web page), you must credit it visibly:
